    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nElltim is an impressively spacious five-bedroom detached family home, complete with a detached garage, set on a generous site of approximately 0.23 acres. Tucked away within The Rise, a mature and highly regarded residential enclave in Bishopstown, this property enjoys one of Cork city's most sought-after locations.\n\nThe home is approached via a gravelled driveway, leading to a level, west-facing garden which is predominantly laid out in lawn and enhanced by mature shrubs and trees. A detached garage is positioned to one side, offering additional storage or potential for a variety of uses.\n\nInternally, the property offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation, thoughtfully arranged to provide an excellent balance between living and bedroom space. The ground floor comprises an entrance porch, welcoming hallway, living room, kitchen, and a versatile dining/sitting room, along with three bedrooms and a main bathroom. Upstairs, there is a spacious landing, two further bedrooms, a bathroom, and a separate WC.\n\nThe location is exceptionally convenient, with close proximity to CUH, UCC, and MTU, as well as Wilton Shopping Centre. It also benefits from easy access to Cork's South Ring Road network. A number of Cork's most highly regarded primary and secondary schools are within easy reach, while the 208 bus service provides regular connectivity to Cork city centre.\n\nThis represents a superb opportunity to acquire a distinctive and spacious family home in a prime residential setting.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.30m x 1.67m\nStep in porch overlooking the front garden with a tiled floor.\n\nEntrance Hall - 6.75m x 1.80m\nThis is a bright and welcoming entrance hall that gives access to all ground floor accommodation. There is a timber floor and built-in storage.\n\nLiving Room - 3.92m x 4.26m\nAccessed through a glass panelled door this well-proportioned living space features a large picture window and original plaster coving. Accessed directly from the entrance hall and overlooking the front garden, this spacious living room features carpet flooring, and ceiling cornicing.\n\nKitchen - 2.72m x 3.62m\nSolid wood floor and eye level kitchen units with glass display cabinet, wine rack and integrated appliances (hob, oven, dishwasher and fridge). There is a tiled floor and tiled over counter splashback. Open plan to the sitting / dining room.\n\nSitting/ Dining Room - 3.04m x 3.63m\nOpen plan to the kitchen this reception space features a tiled open fireplace with built-in alcoves.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.30m x 3.33m\nThis is a generously sized double bedroom overlooking the rear garden featuring built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.13m x 3.33m\nThis is a bright double bedroom overlooking the front of the home features carpet flooring.\n\nOffice / Bedroom 5 - 2.48m x 3.33m\nSpacious single bedroom which overlooks the side of the property features carpet flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.04m x 2.41m\nFully tiled three-piece bathtub suite features built-in storage cabinet.\n\nGarage - \nSpacious garage which offers the opportunity for ample storage.\n\nFirst Floor Landing - \nBright landing which leads to all accommodation on the first floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.98m x 4.54m\nSpacious double bedroom overlooking the front of the home with a laminate wood flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.02m x 4.02m\nThis is a bright double bedroom which overlooks the rear of the property and features built-in wardrobe and laminate wood flooring.\n\nShower Room - 2.48m x 1.34m\nShower room with electric shower fitting features Velux window.\n\n"
      },
